        {
          "text": " Hatimaye, ndugu zangu, mambo yoyote yaliyo ya kweli, yoyote yaliyo ya heshima, yoyote yaliyo ya haki, yoyote yaliyo safi, yoyote yenye kupendeza, yoyote yenye sifa njema; ukiwapo wema wowote, ikiwapo sifa nzuri yoyote, yatafakarini hayo. ",
          "type": "text",
