                  "text": "2 Kor 6:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Najua kudhiliwa, tena najua kufanikiwa; katika hali yoyote, na katika mambo yoyote, nimefundishwa kushiba na kuona njaa, kuwa na vingi na kupungukiwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.4.12",
